{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24493","headline":"近见慕巢尚书诗中屡有叹老思退之意又於洛下新置郊居然宠寄方深归心大速因以长句戏而谕之 · 白居易","name":"近见慕巢尚书诗中屡有叹老思退之意又於洛下新置郊居然宠寄方深归心大速因以长句戏而谕之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近见诗中叹白发，遥知阃外忆东都。\n烟霞偷眼窥来久，富贵黏身摆得无。\n新置林园犹濩落，未终婚嫁且踟蹰。\n应须待到悬车岁，然後东归伴老夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}